BananaChat began as BananaAI inside BananaWiki and was rewritten as a separate
application for the open-source release. BananaWiki's history starts with
1a7c1e99847a5145429b4033293a497a118d85fc (2026-02-20T01:16:43+01:00).
The development history before the public release is not published; this
repository starts from a clean export of the source.

